5
00:00:15,862 --> 00:00:21,342
The weekly low at $143.92 is a support reference.

6
00:00:21,342 --> 00:00:25,742
Resistance is near $160.41.

7
00:00:25,742 --> 00:00:28,942
Price sits below all four moving averages.

8
